---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="IELTS Preparation in Kathmandu | Expert Coaching | Link Wave"
  description="Prepare for IELTS with expert instructors at Link Wave Global Study, Putalisadak. Comprehensive coaching for Listening, Reading, Writing & Speaking. Achieve your target band score."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="tp-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-text reveal">
          <span class="badge">Test Preparation</span>
          <h1>IELTS Preparation</h1>
          <p>Master the International English Language Testing System with expert guidance from Link Wave Global Study. Our comprehensive program ensures you achieve your target band score.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="/LinkWave/contact-us" class="btn btn-gold">Enroll Now</a>
            <a href="tel:+9779851410481" class="btn btn-outline-white">Call Us</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-icon reveal">
          <svg width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1">
            <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/>
            <line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/>
            <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What is IELTS -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">What is IELTS?</h2>
      <div class="content-card reveal">
        <p>The International English Language Testing System (IELTS) is one of the most widely recognized and accepted English proficiency tests for non-native English speakers. It is designed to evaluate an individual's ability to use English in academic, professional, and everyday contexts.</p>
        <p>IELTS is jointly owned by British Council, IDP: IELTS Australia, and Cambridge Assessment English, and is accepted by over <strong>11,000 institutions across more than 140 countries</strong>, including universities, immigration authorities, and employers.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Components -->
  <section class="section bg-light">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">Components of IELTS</h2>
      <p class="section-desc reveal">IELTS assesses four key language skills. The test is available up to four times a month, and is known for being a fair and consistent measure of English language ability.</p>
      
      <div class="components-grid reveal">
        <div class="component-card">
          <div class="comp-icon">
            <svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M3 18v-6a9 9 0 0118 0v6"/><path d="M21 19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1a2 2 0 01-2-2v-3a2 2 0 012-2h3zM3 19a2 2 0 002 2h1a2 2 0 002-2v-3a2 2 0 00-2-2H3z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Listening</h3>
          <p>Evaluates listening ability through summarizing spoken text, filling in blanks, multiple-choice questions, and highlighting incorrect words.</p>
          <span class="duration">30 minutes</span>
        </div>

        <div class="component-card">
          <div class="comp-icon">
            <svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 01-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Speaking</h3>
          <p>Assesses oral fluency and pronunciation through tasks like read aloud, repeat sentence, describe image, and retell lecture.</p>
          <span class="duration">11-14 minutes</span>
        </div>

        <div class="component-card">
          <div class="comp-icon">
            <svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 014 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Reading</h3>
          <p>Tests comprehension using multiple-choice questions, reorder paragraphs, and fill in the blanks.</p>
          <span class="duration">60 minutes</span>
        </div>

        <div class="component-card">
          <div class="comp-icon">
            <svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 013 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Writing</h3>
          <p>Evaluates grammar and coherence with summarize written text and essay writing.</p>
          <span class="duration">60 minutes</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Band Scores -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">IELTS Band Scores</h2>
      
      <div class="score-info reveal">
        <p>The IELTS Listening test contains 40 questions. Each correct answer is awarded 1 mark. Scores out of 40 are converted to the IELTS 9-band scale.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="score-table-wrapper reveal">
        <table class="score-table">
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Band Score</th><th>Listening (out of 40)</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><span class="band">5</span></td><td>16</td></tr>
            <tr><td><span class="band">6</span></td><td>23</td></tr>
            <tr><td><span class="band">7</span></td><td>30</td></tr>
            <tr><td><span class="band">8</span></td><td>35</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h3 class="reveal" style="text-align:center; margin: 3rem 0 1.5rem;">Band Score Descriptions</h3>
      <div class="bands-grid reveal">
        <div class="band-card"><span class="band-num">9</span><strong>Expert</strong><p>Fully operational command of the language</p></div>
        <div class="band-card"><span class="band-num">8</span><strong>Very Good</strong><p>Fully operational command with occasional inaccuracies</p></div>
        <div class="band-card"><span class="band-num">7</span><strong>Good</strong><p>Operational command with occasional inaccuracies</p></div>
        <div class="band-card"><span class="band-num">6</span><strong>Competent</strong><p>Effective command despite some inaccuracies</p></div>
        <div class="band-card"><span class="band-num">5</span><strong>Modest</strong><p>Partial command, copes with overall meaning</p></div>
        <div class="band-card"><span class="band-num">4</span><strong>Limited</strong><p>Basic competence limited to familiar situations</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="calculation-box reveal">
        <h3>How IELTS Band Scores Are Calculated</h3>
        <p>The overall band score is the average of the four section scores, rounded to the nearest whole or half band.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>If the average ends in .25 → rounded up to next half band (6.25 becomes 6.5)</li>
          <li>If the average ends in .75 → rounded up to next whole band (6.75 becomes 7.0)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</MainLayout>

<style>
  .tp-hero {
    background: var(--secondary);
    color: var(--primary-white);
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }
  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .hero-text h1 {
    color: var(--primary-white);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .hero-text p {
    opacity: 0.9;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    max-width: 600px;
  }
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .hero-icon {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
  }
  .btn-gold {
    background: #ffd700;
    color: var(--secondary);
    padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }
  .btn-gold:hover {
    background: #ffe44d;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255,215,0,0.3);
  }
  .btn-outline-white {
    border: 2px solid var(--primary-white);
    color: var(--primary-white);
    padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }
  .btn-outline-white:hover {
    background: var(--primary-white);
    color: var(--secondary);
  }

  .section { padding: 5rem 0; }
  .bg-light { background: var(--gray-100); }
  .section-title { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .section-desc { text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 3rem; color: #666; line-height: 1.7; }

  .content-card {
    background: var(--primary-white);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .content-card p { margin-bottom: 1rem; }

  .components-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .component-card {
    background: var(--primary-white);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
    text-align: center;
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }
  .component-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--tertiary);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(101,45,144,0.08);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .comp-icon { color: var(--tertiary); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .component-card h3 { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .component-card p { color: #666; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .duration { 
    display: inline-block; 
    background: rgba(101,45,144,0.08); 
    color: var(--tertiary); 
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem; 
    border-radius: 12px; 
    font-size: 0.8rem; 
    font-weight: 600; 
  }

  .score-info { text-align: center; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 2rem; }
  .score-table-wrapper { max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto; overflow-x: auto; }
  .score-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  .score-table th, .score-table td { padding: 0.85rem 1rem; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-200); }
  .score-table th { background: var(--secondary); color: white; font-weight: 600; }
  .band { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 32px; height: 32px; background: var(--tertiary); color: white; border-radius: 50%; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem; }

  .bands-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .band-card {
    background: var(--primary-white);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .band-num {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    width: 40px; height: 40px; background: var(--secondary); color: white;
    border-radius: 50%; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .band-card strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .band-card p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #666; line-height: 1.4; }

  .calculation-box {
    background: var(--primary-white);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 3rem auto 0;
  }
  .calculation-box h3 { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .calculation-box ul { margin-top: 0.75rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; }
  .calculation-box li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: #555; }

  .cta-dark {
    background: var(--secondary);
    color: var(--primary-white);
    padding: 4rem 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cta-dark h2 { color: var(--primary-white); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .cta-dark p { opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .cta-buttons { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero-icon { display: none; }
  }
</style>